  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Ever since non-custom Stickers were made available to everyone, I was unable to select Stickers from the Quick Menu Wings.\n\n1. Make sure you don't have an active VRC+ subscription.\n\n2. Open one of the Quick Menu Wings and go to Stickers.\n\n3. Click any stickers.\n\n4. The game doesn't let you place down stickers, instead telling you, \"Feature only available to VRC+ members.\"\n\nExpected result: The game should let you select and place Stickers without VRC+ subscription.\n\nWorkaround: Selecting Stickers from the Radial Menu works. This method is slower than opening the Quick Menu and clicking one of the stickers.",
